message: "If you use this work, please cite it."
title: "The Mass Gap of Pure SU(N) Gauge Theory as a Finite-Aperture Effect"
abstract: "The paper reads the mass gap of pure SU(N) Yang-Mills as a finite-aperture effect: the vacuum is read through a finite aperture, which band-limits, and the gap is the entropy margin below the counting floor kappa_0 = (1/4) ln 3, counted from directed cube paths rather than fitted. Reflection positivity is proved rather than cited at even extent at least four and nonnegative coupling. The repository holds the paper, the Lean development, and the Entroptics analysis code."
